OL,3,AStudent protesters attack government
OL,4,Abuildings in Albania
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlbania's Deputy Prime Minister
OL,7,Fb@KAlbana Kociu has called for
OL,8,F"calmness, self-restraint and maturity"
OL,9,Fand said "Albania does not need to burn
OL,10,Fto change".
